# Scraped listing imagery is NOT committed. Two reasons, both binding:
#  1. Copyright: the photographs belong to the photographer (docs/DATA-SOURCES.md
#     §3.7). Pushing them to a public repo would be republishing them.
#  2. Size: ~87 MB for 30 listings; it does not belong in git history.
# Regenerate with:  python -m pipeline.ingest.fetch_media
data/golden/media/
data/**/media/

